# Licensing and attribution

The [Veterans Benefits Capacity and Due Process Observatory license](observatory/LICENSE.md)
governs the Observatory directory. It sets terms for the Observatory software and applies
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International to its research text and project-created data.

Source publications, third-party material, and U.S. government material retain their
respective terms. Consult the original sources for reuse.

The remainder of the portfolio is subject to applicable copyright. This file records the
existing terms for reuse and identifies their scope.
